{"id":"9198a4b832ce065f","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-top5-nowhere-dense-set.md","title":"ZFC Top5 Nowhere Dense Set","display":"df-zfc-top5-nowhere-dense-set — ZFC Top5 Nowhere Dense Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-top5-nowhere-dense-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-top5-nowhere-dense-set"],"display":"df-zfc-top5-nowhere-dense-set — ZFC Top5 Nowhere Dense Set","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-top5-interior.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-top5-nowhere-dense-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-top5-nowhere-dense-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-top5-nowhere-dense-set — ZFC Top5 Nowhere Dense Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9ac97ecaeb21258a\" href=\"?note=9ac97ecaeb21258a\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"94cf422187df8d8e\" href=\"?note=94cf422187df8d8e\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-top5-interior.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-top5-interior.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau,A,C\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau,A,C\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9ac97ecaeb21258a\" href=\"?note=9ac97ecaeb21258a\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Interior}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Interior}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"94cf422187df8d8e\" href=\"?note=94cf422187df8d8e\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-top5-interior.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-top5-interior.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5NowhereDenseSet}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5NowhereDenseSet}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top5\\text{-}nowhere\\text{-}dense\\text{-}set\\text{-}predicate}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5NowhereDenseSet}_S(X,\\tau,A)\n\\leftrightarrow\nA\\subseteq X\\land\\exists C\\in\\mathcal P(X)\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S(X,\\tau,A,C)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Interior}_S(X,\\tau,C,\\varnothing)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top5\\text{-}nowhere\\text{-}dense\\text{-}set\\text{-}predicate}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5NowhereDenseSet}_S(X,\\tau,A)\n\\leftrightarrow\nA\\subseteq X\\land\\exists C\\in\\mathcal P(X)\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S(X,\\tau,A,C)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Interior}_S(X,\\tau,C,\\varnothing)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Nowhere density is expressed through the empty interior of the closure.  Passing <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\">\\(\\varnothing\\)</span> directly removes an inessential existential interior witness while retaining all topology guards inherited from the sourced predicates.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md","status":"resolved","id":"9ac97ecaeb21258a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-top5-interior.md","status":"resolved","id":"94cf422187df8d8e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-top5-interior.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md","status":"resolved","id":"9ac97ecaeb21258a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-top5-interior.md","status":"resolved","id":"94cf422187df8d8e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Interior}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch19/58-df-zfc-top5-interior.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\tau,A,C\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Interior}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5NowhereDenseSet}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top5\\text{-}nowhere\\text{-}dense\\text{-}set\\text{-}predicate}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5NowhereDenseSet}_S(X,\\tau,A)\n\\leftrightarrow\nA\\subseteq X\\land\\exists C\\in\\mathcal P(X)\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S(X,\\tau,A,C)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Interior}_S(X,\\tau,C,\\varnothing)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\varnothing","display":false}],"bytes":1282,"backlinks":[{"id":"0e224bb32227a0f8","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop5NowhereDenseSet}_S\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[../batch03/58-df-zfc-top5-nowhere-dense-set.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3596","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-top5-nowhere-dense-set.md|58-df-zfc-top5-nowhere-dense-set]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["9ac97ecaeb21258a","94cf422187df8d8e"]}